        "original_id": "543d2459-4ae6-5256-be6c-c0c3a51598d6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: Blizzard of 1888, Great Blizzard of 1888\n- Places: North-east of North America, New York City, East Coast, Chesapeake Bay, Maine, Atlantic provinces of Canada\n- Topics: Severe winter storm impact\n\nFacts:\n- The Blizzard of 1888 hit the north-east of North America.\n- BLIZZARD! The Storm That Changed America concentrates on New York City in its coverage of the Blizzard of 1888.\n- The Great Blizzard of 1888 was referred to as the Great White Hurricane.\n- The storm paralyzed the East Coast from the Chesapeake Bay to Maine.\n- The storm also paralyzed the Atlantic provinces of Canada.",
